m1: "Manual: requires the exact exception type\n(throw-exactly)"
m3: "Manual: not directly awaited / is used\n(no-await, where, value-used)"
m4: "Manual: Invoking / reference type\n(awaiting, value-func)"
m5: "Manual: becauseArgs\n(because-args, message-because-args)"
m7: "Manual: not a string constant / wildcards other than\n(message-variable, message-wildcard)"
f1: "Fixed: await Should.ThrowAsync<T>(act[, because])\n(simple, func-task-reference, because)"
f2: "Fixed: (await Should.ThrowAsync<T>(act)).Message.ShouldX(...)\n(message-contains, -starts, -ends, -exact, -because)"
